THE CATFATHER — asset credit
=============================

Cat pixel art: "Cat Pack - Pochi" / Mega Pack by ToffeeCraft
https://toffeecraft.itch.io/

The sprites in game/assets/ are extracted from ToffeeCraft's FREE pack
(personal-use license): character sprites, furniture, UI elements, and
the dog rival. Trimmed to alpha bounds; no resampling.

License note: the free pack is for PERSONAL USE. If this game is ever
released commercially, buy the paid pack from the same itch.io page —
it covers commercial use.

Music: "speakeasy_loop.wav" is synthesised from scratch by
tools/make_music.py — additive synthesis and filtered noise, no samples
and no third-party audio. Re-runnable and free of licence obligations.

Mobster cat art in assets/cats/mob/ is separate from the ToffeeCraft pack:
most was supplied by the author, and carmela/sammy_bull were generated with
SpriteCook. See assets/cats/mob/README.md for per-file provenance.

Game code (GDScript, project files) is the author's own work.
